# ParkMate — Parking Rescue Specification

## Trigger
The requested parking slot is unavailable or the booking cannot be completed.

## Inputs
- Requested location
- Requested time window
- Available nearby listings
- Price
- Distance or estimated travel time, when available
- Listing freshness and confirmation status

## Recommendation Rules
1. Exclude listings that are unavailable or not approved.
2. Exclude listings that fail a fresh availability check.
3. Rank eligible alternatives using proximity, price and freshness.
4. Explain briefly why each alternative is suggested.
5. Revalidate availability before confirming the new booking.

## Important
Do not claim live crowd detection without an integrated real-time data source. Do not invent confidence percentages.
